> **How to read this**
>
> This evaluation was run against **simulated students**. It shows whether the
> principles you designed are actually carried out in the agent's behaviour; it is
> **not evidence of learning**. Learning can only be claimed from a study with real
> learners.
>
> AI judgement is provisional until it has been compared with human ratings. The
> automatic (deterministic) checks are the more trustworthy number.
